<title>USA: Winnebago, Ill., won by  Piper Jaffray.</title>
<headline>Winnebago, Ill., won by  Piper Jaffray.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-04-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>Piper Jaffray Inc., said it won $6.275 million of Winnebago, Ill., general obligation refunding alternate bonds, Series 1997, with a net interest cost of 5.22 percent.</p>
</text>
